* LI.FI bridge and DEX aggregator
** Execution model
*** API li.quest/v1 builds calldata
*** LiFiDiamond (EIP-2535) executes
*** 44 facets, helpers, libraries
*** Periphery: Executor, Receivers, Permit2Proxy
** Flows
*** BridgeData + SwapData[]
*** swap, then bridge the real output
*** validateBridgeData modifiers
*** NON_EVM_ADDRESS for non-EVM receivers
*** Receiver -> Executor destination calls
** Allow-list
*** contract + selector pairs
*** 0xffffffff approveTo-only marker
*** enforced in SwapperV2, not LibSwap
** Governance
*** Safe 3 of 6 -> timelock (3 h) -> diamondCut
*** EOA pauser: pause or remove a facet
*** unpause without delay
